# Alaya Design System

All UI should be built using `@alayacare/alaya-design-system` components. Do **not** use raw HTML elements when a design system component exists.

## Setup (already done in main.ts)

The plugin is installed with `app.use(install, { lang: 'en' })` and CSS is imported globally. You do **not** need to repeat this setup.

## Importing Components

Components are **not** registered globally. Import them per-file:

```vue
<script setup lang="ts">
import { AcButton, AcInputText, AcCard } from '@alayacare/alaya-design-system'
</script>

<template>
  <AcCard>
    <template #content>
      <AcInputText v-model="name" placeholder="Enter name" />
      <AcButton label="Submit" @click="handleSubmit" />
    </template>
  </AcCard>
</template>
```

## Naming Convention

All components are prefixed with `Ac`: `AcButton`, `AcDialog`, `AcDataTable`, etc.

## Available Components (non-exhaustive)

**Layout**: AcCard, AcDivider, AcPanel, AcSplitter, AcToolbar, AcScrollPanel
**Form**: AcInputText, AcTextarea, AcDropdown, AcCheckbox, AcRadioButton, AcInputNumber, AcInputSwitch, AcMultiSelect, AcCalendar, AcPassword, AcAutoComplete, AcInputPhoneNumber, AcEditor
**Buttons**: AcButton, AcSplitButton, AcSpeedDial, AcToggleButton, AcSelectButton
**Data**: AcDataTable, AcDataView, AcPaginator, AcTree, AcTreeTable, AcOrderList, AcPickList, AcTimeline, AcOrganizationChart
**Overlay**: AcDialog, AcSidebar, AcOverlayPanel, AcConfirmDialog, AcConfirmPopup, AcToast
**Navigation**: AcMenu, AcMenubar, AcTabMenu, AcTabView, AcBreadcrumb, AcSteps, AcMegaMenu, AcTieredMenu, AcPanelMenu, AcContextMenu
**Feedback**: AcMessage, AcInlineMessage, AcProgressBar, AcProgressSpinner, AcSkeleton, AcBadge, AcTag, AcChip
**Media**: AcGalleria, AcCarousel, AcImagePreview, AcChart, AcMap
**Misc**: AcAvatar, AcAvatarGroup, AcAccordion, AcFileUpload, AcEmptyState, AcHeading

## Services

```typescript
import { useAcToast, useAcConfirmation } from '@alayacare/alaya-design-system'

const toast = useAcToast()
toast.add({ severity: 'success', summary: 'Done', detail: 'Record saved', life: 3000 })

const confirm = useAcConfirmation()
confirm.require({ message: 'Are you sure?', accept: () => { /* ... */ } })
```

## Grid Utilities

Use `acds-row` and `acds-col-*` classes from `system.utils.css` for layout:

```html
<div class="acds-row">
  <div class="acds-col-6">Left</div>
  <div class="acds-col-6">Right</div>
</div>
```

